      "text": "chat_router.ag_ui_chat_endpoint\n1. authenticate user · parse RunAgentInput or MUCGPT body\n2. validate messages + model\n3. Valkey run lock per conversation (409 if busy)\n4. persist: ownership check · send only new message if checkpoint exists",
