      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795685009403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RUN_STARTED                         run begins\nTEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK                  answer tokens\nTOOL_CALL_CHUNK / TOOL_CALL_RESULT  tool step; live label = the tool's status_message argument\nCUSTOM (canvas)                     live canvas edits\nRUN_FINISHED                        token usage · interrupt outcome when a tool waits for approval\nSTATE_SNAPSHOT · MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT  best-effort snapshots before interrupted RUN_FINISHED\n                                    snapshot failures are logged; RUN_FINISHED can still be sent\nRUN_ERROR                           exception caught in the executor's graph-streaming block",
      "originalText": "RUN_STARTED                         run begins\nTEXT_MESSAGE_CHUNK                  answer tokens\nTOOL_CALL_CHUNK / TOOL_CALL_RESULT  tool step; live label = the tool's status_message argument\nCUSTOM (canvas)                     live canvas edits\nRUN_FINISHED                        token usage · interrupt outcome when a tool waits for approval\nSTATE_SNAPSHOT · MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT  best-effort snapshots before interrupted RUN_FINISHED\n                                    snapshot failures are logged; RUN_FINISHED can still be sent\nRUN_ERROR                           exception caught in the executor's graph-streaming block",
      "fontSize": 16.571428571428573,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
